=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c14-t1-l-q23\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>They did not allow for the effects of climate change.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">24</strong><span>What do Rob and Carla think that the authorities in Miami should do immediately?</span></span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c14-t1-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>take measures to restore ecosystems</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c14-t1-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>pay for a new flood prevention system</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c14-t1-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>stop disposing of waste materials into the ocean</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">25</strong><span>What do they agree should be the priority for international action?</span></span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c14-t1-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>greater coordination of activities</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c14-t1-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>more sharing of information</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c14-t1-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>agreement on shared policies</span></div></div></div>","sourceQuesti